<td id="A3.T3.5.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.T3.5.6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Anthropic</span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.5.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.T3.5.6.2.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="A3.T3.5.6.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="A3.T3.5.6.2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T3.5.6.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T3.5.6.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Claude 4 Sonnet</span></span>
</span></span><span id="A3.T3.5.6.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"><span id="A3.T3.5.6.2.3.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.5.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.T3.5.6.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">3 / 15</span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.5.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.T3.5.6.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">6 / 30</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.5.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.5.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A3.T3.5.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Anthropic</span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.5.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A3.T3.5.7.2.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="A3.T3.5.7.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="A3.T3.5.7.2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T3.5.7.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T3.5.7.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Claude 4 Opus*</span></span>
</span></span><span id="A3.T3.5.7.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"><span id="A3.T3.5.7.2.3.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.5.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A3.T3.5.7.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">15 / 75</span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.5.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A3.T3.5.7.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">30 / 150</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A3.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">In addition to cost, token inflation impacts time. Transformer models scale with <math id="A3.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(n^{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(n^{2})</annotation></semantics></math> in sequence length. With a 2<math id="A3.SS1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> token increase, Language X requires <math id="A3.SS1.p4.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(2^{2})=4\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(2^{2})=4\times</annotation></semantics></math> more compute.
This means training that takes 90 days for English would take <math id="A3.SS1.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim</annotation></semantics></math>360 days for Language X on the same hardware.
For inference time, decoding scales approximately linearly with token count. A prompt+completion that takes 2 seconds in English may take about 4 seconds in Language X.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">These multipliers apply whether the additional tokens appear in the input (prompt) or output (completion), and they exacerbate cost disparities for low-resource languages.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Prompt</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para"><pre id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">
You must only reply with ’Final Answer: X’ where X is A, B, C, or D.
Do NOT add explanations, reasoning, or extra text.
Question:
&lt;question text&gt;
Choices:
A. &lt;option 1&gt;
B. &lt;option 2&gt;
C. &lt;option 3&gt;
D. &lt;option 4&gt;
Your response must be strictly formatted as:
Final Answer: X
</pre>
</div>
